#: ab9b35964931499e9a6b4e0381d07022
msgid ""
"The SERIAL7 port (UART7) is normally for ESC telemetry, and has an R7 pin on"
" both of the ESC connectors."
msgstr "SERIAL7 端口（UART7）通常用于 ESC 数传，两个 ESC 连接器上均有 R7 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:78
#: a17a1e33900b4b308eeb68867f24caf8
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:80
#: 2d3d29b6ed1d40ae92354e06f25047f7
msgid ""
"The R6 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"R6 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:82
#: 4a2b56d99943456f91c658a5bd8a289d
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the R6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin "
"for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，R6 引脚也可配置为真正的 UART RX 引脚用于双向系统，方法是将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」，使其成为 SERIAL6 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:84
#: e25c06dd10a44595b5cedc6b941f80a4
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:86
#: 4bb88bc1f2e74cef8dd498636bb5798c
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:88
#: 18a270f6384349c8a2ad0f222546b0d4
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:90
#: e4c39628b6244d89810c4b31b6a27967
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:92
#: 862211e8894048e383f51531f4388ebc
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R6 外还需要 T6 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:94
#: 419c607a94f047798c9ed52ff8d8828d
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T6 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:96
#: 1f06cc734db8445e81f8d0449103bbbc
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:99
#: c83a4be9fe814b90a9133c8830a98421
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:101
#: 862affef97fc4bd4a9259fed77fd3c8d
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART including "
"SERIAL6/UART6 . You need to set the following parameters to enable support "
"for FrSky S.PORT (example shows SERIAL6). Note this assumes the RC input is "
"using default (:ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0). Obviously, if "
"using :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 for full duplex RC prtocols,"
" you must a different UART for FrSky Telemetry."
msgstr ""
"支持通过任意 UART（包括 SERIAL6/UART6）的 Tx 引脚使用 FrSky 数传。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT "
"支持（示例显示 SERIAL6）。注意：这假设 RC 输入使用默认配置（:ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = "
"0）。显然，若使用 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 以支持全双工 RC 协议，则必须使用其他 "
"UART 用于 FrSky 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:103
#: 704ba9df83cf4a3fa99a8e8c83febd97
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:104
#: 9babb134f8fd4de0a1e8e1996e548b28
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:107
#: 0a4a45bdc7844ee9a1e9414e0c6fd695
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:109
#: e72c36218d2a4f0b9d8fde646e03c95a
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
