msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:114
#: 346a50bea55d45dbb7057c4aac713d91
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs are available via two "
"JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7 最多支持 8 路 PWM 输出。输出通过两个 JST-SH 连接器引出。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 及所有 PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:116
#: 2bdaebc6746f4a2bbe61286f88775ce5
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:118
#: f94dd51e2c644ecf83a7aa0f73c138af
msgid "PWM 1, 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:119
#: 0d35e809064d4108ac545a81a0eca01d
msgid "PWM 3, 4 in group2"
