#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:123
#: e81220cae3dd41ab914642f4b1d4952a
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率（PWM 或 DShot）。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:127
