msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:153
#: df9084e1c1b64fd8a0fb75229f9e50ef
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteH7 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:156
#: 3ac20b46b48044709fe87a7fe553efa3
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:158
#: 99f8a23378744316a8f59851b89e7adb
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"KakuteH7\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有 「KakuteH7」 的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:161
#: 8c025ec9deac4109b92547c093f0a3a0
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:163
#: 58cfd432bb69417b8a3b292655af3902
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件加载可通过 DFU 完成：按住引导程序按钮并插入 USB。然后使用您常用的 DFU 加载工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:167
#: 75a44da5d1c74354b80e883295ab81fb
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "加载初始固件后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。后续更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
